# ElTo 40-apps: OPTIONAL user applications. Installed only with --with-apps.
# Exactly the set proven in the ElTo VM spike boots; nothing was added beyond
# it (scope discipline: new apps need the owner's approval).
# Verified against the live Arch repos on 2026-11-27.

foot              # Wayland-native terminal, tiny (used by all spike boots).
konsole           # KDE terminal (dockfn spike boots).
dolphin           # KDE file manager.
kate              # KDE text editor.
gwenview          # KDE image viewer.
okular            # KDE document/PDF viewer.
kcalc             # KDE calculator (earliest spike boots).
